        new("COVID-19 and Influenza", "6.0 m (inclusive)", "5 years (exclusive)", "Influenza: >= 28 days; COVID-19: >= 56 days", "Eligible when neither dose is recorded", "Evaluate each component independently using the local screening rules.", "Both components must be eligible for an eligible result. Two ineligible components are ineligible; mixed results or a component requiring review result in manual review.", "Les deux composantes doivent être admissibles. Deux composantes inadmissibles donnent un résultat inadmissible; des résultats différents ou une composante exigeant une révision donnent une révision manuelle.")
